OL,3,GNEWSATimeline of RAF Fairford incident
OL,4,Aand the investigation so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe public is slowly getting more
OL,7,Finformation about what happened near
OL,8,Fthe RAF Fairford airbase at the weekend
OL,9,F- but many questions remain unanswered.
OL,11,FWe know that two early-morning calls
OL,12,Fwere made to police about suspicious
OL,13,Fvehicles, and that five men, all
OL,14,FBritish nationals in their 20s, were
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of explosives
OL,16,Foffences and terrorism offences.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
