OL,3,GNEWSATimeline of RAF Fairford incident
OL,4,Aand the investigation so far
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe also know they were later released
OL,7,Fon bail, and the BBC understands that
OL,8,Fone of the men was the first 999
OL,9,Fcaller. Prime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,10,Fnow said the UK government believes
OL,11,FIran "played a part" in the incident.
OL,13,FHere is what we know about how the
OL,14,Fincident unfolded, and what has
OL,15,Fhappened in the days since.
